[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:13. The Greenwood Boys]
[00:00.940]Passage 13|文章十三
[00:02.790]The Greenwood Boys|绿林少年
[00:05.815]The Greenwood Boys are a group of popular singers.|绿林少年是一个受欢迎的歌手组合。
[00:10.815]At present they are visiting all parts of the country.|目前他们正在全国各地巡回演出。
[00:14.955]They will be arriving here tomorrow.|他们将于明天抵达这里。
[00:18.570]They will be coming by train.|他们将乘火车前来。
[00:21.495]And most of the young people in the town will be meeting them at the station.|城里的大部分年轻人将在车站迎接他们。
[00:26.425]Tomorrow evening,|明天晚上，
[00:28.785]they will be singing at the Workers' Club.|他们将在工人俱乐部唱歌。
[00:32.060]The Greenwood Boys will be staying for five days.|绿林少年将停留五天。
[00:36.770]During this time,|在此期间，
[00:38.860]they will give five performances.|他们将举行五场演出。
[00:41.765]As usual,|像往常一样，
[00:43.620]the police will have a difficult time.|警察将面临艰难时刻。
[00:47.040]They will be trying to keep order.|他们将努力维持秩序。
[00:50.365]It is always the same on these occasions.|在这些场合下，情况总是如此。